        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Days of Ruin is an indie-developed post-apocalyptic survival game played in third-person shooter mode. Wield weapons to eliminate every zombie in your path, explore every map corner to scavenge critical supplies, and strategically build your talent tree after each upgrade—ensuring victory in even the deadliest encounters! With randomized equipment stats and high-stakes boss drops, the game challenges players to outsmart hordes through cunning survival tactics</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Random Equipment Attributes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features a dynamic loot system where equipment drops randomly—bosses have higher drop rates, and each piece of gear boasts procedurally generated stats!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915670/extras/29c1bb8a852dd077abd9bd02efcbfa7e.avif?t=1762497163\" width=540 height=582 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Talent System</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players earn XP by defeating zombies, level up to unlock talents, and build unique playstyles through diverse choices!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915670/extras/6e346779afbe004149846298b47cab1a.avif?t=1762497163\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Supply Crafting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival supplies can be obtained by defeating zombies or scavenging raw materials to craft your own gear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915670/extras/37e85ec44e439c589eeb6e944f03c6c9.avif?t=1762497163\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Quick Teleport</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore new maps to unlock the teleporter and quickly traverse different areas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3915670/extras/5468be0c50bed448ca4ccc58db62df80.avif?t=1762497163\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >More Content</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More content awaits your discovery!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Final</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is independently developed by a single creator — bugs and suboptimal designs are inevitable. If you have feedback or suggestions, join the player community QQ Group: 649145932. Your contributions help improve the experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your feedback in player reviews is invaluable—I’ll promptly review and update the game based on your suggestions!</p>",
